        {
          "ID": "c1764188449044155000",
          "Author": "claude",
          "Timestamp": "2025-11-26T12:20:49.044155-08:00",
          "Text": "In the comment type system, 'B' stands for Bug - identifying an issue or problem in the content. A 'Blocker' type doesn't exist in this schema. The available types are: Q (Question), S (Suggestion), B (Bug), T (TODO), E (Enhancement). For blocking issues, you could use B with HIGH priority.",
